        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>NF-κB信号通路与Notch信号通路</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 20px;\n    color: #333;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 20px 0 25px 0;\n  }\n  p.body-text {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    background: #fdf9f3;\n    margin: 0 auto 35px auto;\n    padding: 10px 15px 15px 15px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .slide-tag {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #2f2f4f;\n    color: #f0c419;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    padding: 2px 6px;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .slide-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin: 0 0 15px 0;\n  }\n\n  /* NF-KB diagram grid */\n  .nfkb-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr 1fr;\n    gap: 6px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n  .nfkb-grid .cell {\n    background: #dfe6f0;\n    padding: 8px 4px;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n  }\n  .nfkb-grid .cell.center {\n    background: #eef0f5;\n  }\n  .caption-box {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    padding: 8px;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n\n  /* Notch diagram placeholder */\n  .notch-figure {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 220px;\n    background: #f3e6d8;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #888;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .notch-caption-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #555;\n    padding: 0 4px;\n  }\n  .sound-icon {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #444;\n    margin-top: 5px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <h1>NF-κB信号通路</h1>\n  <p class=\"body-text\">\n    相对于RTK相关信号通路，NF-KB信号通路的功能也更加特化一些，与TGF-β和Wnt信号相比高度集中于炎症反应。\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder\">\n    <span class=\"slide-tag\">丄丄丄丄</span>\n    <div class=\"slide-title\">经典NF-KB信号的功能</div>\n    <div class=\"nfkb-grid\">\n      <div class=\"cell\">细胞水平</div>\n      <div class=\"cell\">细胞增殖和凋亡</div>\n      <div class=\"cell\">肿瘤发生和发展</div>\n      <div class=\"cell center\">个体水平</div>\n      <div class=\"cell\">炎症细胞的活化</div>\n      <div class=\"cell\">炎症反应</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"caption-box\">\n      相对于RTK相关信号通路，NF-KB信号通路的功能也更加特化一些，与TGF-β和Wnt信号相比，<br>\n      高度集中于炎症反应。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1>Notch信号通路</h1>\n  <p class=\"body-text\">\n    通过膜蛋白作为配体和受体，介导两个细胞相互靠近接触之后的活化效应。Notch 与配体结合，经过 ADAM 剪切释放胞外段与配体一同降解，经 γ-secretase 剪切释放胞内段传导信号 Notch 胞内段进入细胞质传导信号。\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder\">\n    <span class=\"slide-tag\">丄丄丄丄</span>\n    <div class=\"slide-title\">Notch信号通路的调控</div>\n    <div class=\"notch-figure\">\n      [Diagram: Notch信号通路调控示意图，含膜结构、受体配体结合及信号转导箭头示意]\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"notch-caption-row\">\n      <span>Chris Siebel and Urban Lendahl, <em>Physiol Rev</em>, 2017</span>\n      <span>Notch配体的成熟受到调控</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sound-icon\">&#128266;</div>\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
